  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Caritas in Poland Support to Conflict-Affected Individuals from Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partner: Caritas Poland

Contribution to Caritas Appeal: EA18/2022 Poland

Total number of direct beneficiaries (individuals): 69,000

Context: Conflict-affected refugees in Poland are provided with holistic services and Caritas Ukraine and Caritas Spes provide immediate assistance to conflict-affected people in Ukraine.

Key activities: providing financial Assistance, safe and Dignified Accommodation, psychosocial &amp; livelihood support, and warehouse and operations support.

Activity split:
20%: Food, nutrition &amp; livelihoods in emergencies
20%: Non-food items in emergencies
30%: Protection in emergencies
30%: Shelter in emergencies</narrative>
  </description>
